1
00:00:00,410 --> 00:00:01,810
(Leonard(there is a knock on the door):)Who is it?

2
00:00:01,810 --> 00:00:03,530
(Sheldon:)Amy Farrah Fowler.

3
00:00:06,430 --> 00:00:08,650
(Sheldon:)Darn! She found me!

4
00:00:08,650 --> 00:00:10,530
(Leonard:)She's been here before.

5
00:00:11,820 --> 00:00:14,950
(Sheldon:)The only flaw in an
otherwise perfect plan.

6
00:00:16,790 --> 00:00:17,990
(Sheldon:)Now, get my back, Jack.

7
00:00:17,990 --> 00:00:20,240
(Leonard:)What do you want to do?
Tell her I'm not here.

8
00:00:20,240 --> 00:00:21,990
(Leonard:)Okay, where are you?
I don't know.

9
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:23,410
(Sheldon:)You'll have to devise a scenario

10
00:00:23,410 --> 00:00:24,910
(Sheldon:)that plausibly
explains my absence,

11
00:00:24,910 --> 00:00:29,720
(Sheldon:)keeping in mind that the key to
a good lie lies in the details.

12
00:00:41,850 --> 00:00:43,100
(Leonard:)Hi, Amy.

13
00:00:43,100 --> 00:00:44,480
(Leonard:)Sheldon's not here.

14
00:00:44,480 --> 00:00:46,080
(Sheldon:)All right.

15
00:00:51,440 --> 00:00:53,810
(Sheldon:)Way to go on the details.

16
00:00:55,750 --> 00:00:58,330
(Leonard:)Thanks again for
doing this, Bernadette.

